### Run from IntelliJ's HTTP Client or translate into Postman/curl.
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### List sample catalogue
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Place order (rerun with the SAME key to test retry safety)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: learning-demo-001

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyKey": "learning-order-001"
}

### Test: out-of-stock error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 50,
  "idempotencyKey": "oversell-experiment-001"
}
